      "created_timestamp": 1794299229,
      "date_label": "Nov 10, 2026",
      "text": "这是个很有意思的观点。仅仅因为「精妙的算法」最后都被力大砖飞的算力系统给解决了，不代表这些算法本身的研究是没有意义的\n\n想搞训练，你必须先提出正确的问题，先得到正确的收敛，数据飞轮才能转起来。算法研究本身就是非常有意义的开创性活动。至于研究出来的算法，它们本来也只是副产品",
      "media": null,
      "quote": {
        "id": "2119783945210613804",
        "url": "https://x.com/imprashantrai1/status/2119783945210613804",
        "author_name": "Prashant Rai",
        "author_handle": "imprashantrai1",
        "text": "The Bitter Lesson is often mistaken for an argument against algorithmic ingenuity, when it’s really an argument against hardcoding our own ingenuity into the system.",
        "media": null
      },
      "likes": 6,
      "retweets": 0,
      "replies": 0
